; -- Item Flavor Texts (Division I) --
Flavor_StimOverclock="Removes all thermal safety limiters. Voiding weapon warranty is encouraged."
Flavor_OvertimeAccelerator="Livestock-grade cardiac stimulant. Knee cartilage degradation is not covered."
Flavor_HostileTakeover="Floods your weapon with unshielded isotopes. Expect 6th-degree burns."
Flavor_QuadJump="Quad-jumping capable boots. Thrusters salvaged from an aircraft crash."
Flavor_VampiricClause="Experimental blood-recycling suit. Gross but efficient."
Flavor_ReconStriker="90% recycled mining scrap. Seatbelts removed to save on shipping costs."
Flavor_AirSupport="Parachutes and ejector seats not included."
Flavor_Hellbender="Rear turret wiring exposed. Bring a friend to absorb shrapnel."
Flavor_HeavyLitigation="Cabin ventilation is currently broken. Hearing loss and exhaust poisoning are not covered by your contract."
Flavor_BoardroomClearer="Long-term radiation safe radius exceeds the size of this arena."

; -- Item Flavor Texts (Division II) --
Flavor_EmergencyResupply="Recycled munitions scraped off the arena floor. May still contain trace amounts of previous contenders."
Flavor_PersonalTranslocator="Quantum teleporter. Only occasionally leaves teeth behind."
Flavor_BioHazard="Toxic sludge tank strapped to your spine. Do not fall backward."
Flavor_KineticSeverance="Deflects shrapnel away from you."
Flavor_SpiderMine="Surplus factory rejects."
Flavor_AdrenalineShot="Progressively regenerates health. If you don't mind running with a needle stuck on you."
Flavor_GhostProtocol="Pills that make you effectively transparent by separating your molecules. Don't worry, fully vanishing is rare."
Flavor_VitalityBailout="Chemical sludge that numbs fatal trauma."
Flavor_StationarySeverance="Cannot retreat, turn fully, or protect your spine."
Flavor_AntiTrust="Detonation only after projectile outside of chamber not guaranteed."

